+# Async Runtime Policy
+
+No final async runtime decision is currently recorded for this project. The record shows async-std was initially selected, after which the choice was reconsidered toward tokio on the stated rationale of ecosystem advantages; however, the same record explicitly notes that the runtime selection "remains under evaluation," so no settled current choice exists to document here.
